{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15093","headline":"赋得花发上林 · 周渭","name":"赋得花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灼灼花凝雪，春来发上林。\n向风初散蘂，垂叶欲成阴。\n人过香随远，烟晴色自深。\n净时空结雾，疎处未藏禽。\n菶茸何年植，间关几日吟。\n一枝如可冀，不负折芳心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}